\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Lord, in the strength of grace,
\par With a glad heart and free,
\par Myself, my residue of days,
\par A consecrate to Thee.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Thy ransomed servant, I
\par Restore to Thee Thy own;
\par And, from this moment, live or die
\par To serve my God alone.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

